  "finding": "The ble_link_live ENTITY must not be used to diagnose this.",
  "why": "_ble_link_liveness composes it from is_connected, is_usable, cooldown, last_send_age_seconds, queue_depth, queue_dispatch_paused and saga_active, and it is a coordinator-tick derived value.",
